  "main": "\n<section class=\"tsc-about-hero relative isolate overflow-hidden border-b\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 10%, transparent)\"><div class=\"tsc-about-hero__inner\"><div class=\"tsc-about-hero__copy\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 140ms;\"><h1 class=\"tsc-about-hero__title font-serif\">Personalised medicine,<br><span class=\"italic text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">root-cause</span> care.</h1></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 260ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 260ms;\"><p class=\"tsc-about-hero__lede\">A boutique Harley Street practice for those who expect the depth of investigation, clinical judgement and continuity that transformative health demands.</p></div><div class=\"tsc-about-hero__actions\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 380ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 380ms;\"><a href=\"/#enquiry\" class=\"btn-luxe\">Book a Consultation</a><a href=\"/specialists/\" class=\"btn-ghost-luxe\">Meet the Specialists</a></div></div><figure class=\"tsc-about-hero__media\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 180ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 180ms;\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/about-clinic-door.png\" alt=\"Entrance to The Schoeman Clinic, Harley Street\" class=\"tsc-kenburns\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tsc-about-hero__scrim\"></span><figcaption class=\"tsc-about-hero__caption\">96 Harley Street · London W1G 7HY</figcaption></figure></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-1 gap-14 px-6 pt-28 pb-16 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16 md:px-12 md:pt-36 md:pb-20\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div class=\"flex items-center eyebrow\">Redefining Vitality</div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms;\"><h2 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[2rem] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-[2.6rem]\">Expert-led functional medicine, <span class=\"italic text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">focused on the root cause.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-7 md:pt-2\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 160ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 160ms;\"><p class=\"text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.9] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic offers a uniquely personalised approach to hormone, longevity, and functional medicine. Rather than simply treating symptoms, we identify and address the root causes of hormonal and metabolic imbalance through advanced diagnostics and precision medicine, integrating evidence-based practice with a multi-systems view of health.</p></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 260ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 260ms;\"><p class=\"mt-8 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.9] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Each patient receives a highly tailored treatment plan combining hormonal optimisation, functional medicine and preventive longevity strategies, designed to restore balance, improve vitality and support long-term health.</p></div></div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats\"><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__item\"><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__num\" data-countup=\"\">20+</div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__label\">Years of clinical practice</div></div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__item\"><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__num\" data-countup=\"\">360°</div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__label\">Systems-based diagnostics</div></div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__item\"><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__num\" data-countup=\"\">1:1</div><div class=\"tsc-about-stats__label\">Physician-led throughout</div></div></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-6 px-6 pb-28 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-8 md:px-12 md:pb-36\"><div class=\"md:col-span-7\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div class=\"relative h-[32rem] w-full overflow-hidden sm:h-[38rem] lg:h-[42rem] xl:h-[44rem]\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/about-consultation.webp\" alt=\"Consultation at The Schoeman Clinic\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover tsc-kenburns\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 15%, transparent) 0%, transparent 40%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 70%, transparent) 100%)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 p-8 md:p-12\"><div class=\"text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.36em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">The Practice</div><h3 class=\"mt-5 max-w-lg font-serif text-[1.6rem] leading-[1.15] text-[color:var(--background)] md:text-[2.1rem]\">A quiet, considered environment for the <span class=\"italic\">depth of conversation</span> meaningful medicine requires.</h3><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-6 inline-block h-px w-14\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 140ms;\"><div class=\"h-[32rem] w-full overflow-hidden sm:h-[38rem] lg:h-[42rem] xl:h-[44rem]\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/about-bronze-forms.jpg\" alt=\"An abstract study in bronze\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover tsc-kenburns tsc-kenburns--offset\"></div></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"relative\" style=\"background:var(--charcoal);color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-25\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(70% 90% at 10% 10%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 18%, transparent) 0%, transparent 55%)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(60% 80% at 90% 90%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--champagne) 14%, transparent) 0%, transparent 60%)\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-28 md:px-12 md:py-36\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start\" style=\"top:9rem\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne)\">Core Values</span></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms;\"><h2 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[2.4rem] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-[3rem] lg:text-[2.6rem] xl:text-[3.2rem]\">Guided by integrity, science and <span class=\"italic\" style=\"color:var(--champagne)\">your vitality.</span></h2></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 240ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 240ms;\"><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.85]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">Six principles shape every consultation, every diagnostic pathway and every treatment plan we design.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 360ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 360ms;\"><a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe\" href=\"/methodology/\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75);border-color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75 / 0.45)\">Our Methodology</a></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-12 lg:col-span-8\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[1.125rem] top-2 bottom-2 w-px md:left-[1.625rem]\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--champagne) 22%, transparent)\"></div><div class=\"space-y-16 md:space-y-20\"><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">I</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Precision Medicine</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">Every patient is biologically unique. Advanced diagnostics, deep clinical insight and highly personalised strategies address each individual's physiology, genetics and lifestyle.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 90ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 90ms;\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">II</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Root-Cause Medicine</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">We go beyond symptom management. Systems-based evaluation identifies and treats the underlying drivers of hormonal, metabolic and longevity-related conditions.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 180ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 180ms;\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">III</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Clinical Excellence</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">Extensive medical experience is paired with the most advanced developments in hormone, functional and longevity medicine, delivered to the highest standard.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 270ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 270ms;\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">IV</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Exceptional Experience</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">Premium medical care requires time, attention and a meaningful doctor–patient partnership. Each consultation is thoughtful, thorough and centred on the individual.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 360ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 360ms;\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">V</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Integrity &amp; Rigour</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">All recommendations are grounded in evidence-based medicine, ethical practice, and a commitment to delivering safe and effective treatment.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group relative pl-12 md:pl-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 450ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 450ms;\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[0.95rem] top-[0.45rem] h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full md:left-[1.45rem]\" style=\"background:var(--champagne)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:gap-10\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[2.2rem] italic leading-none md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--champagne);min-width:3.5rem\">VI</span><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h3 class=\"font-serif text-[1.25rem] leading-tight md:text-[1.45rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.94 0.008 75)\">Longevity &amp; Vitality</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.92rem] leading-[1.85] md:text-[0.95rem]\" style=\"color:oklch(0.9 0.008 75 / 0.72)\">Our focus extends beyond disease treatment to optimising health, performance and long-term wellbeing across every decade of life.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"relative\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-28 md:px-12 md:py-40\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-10 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div class=\"flex items-center eyebrow\">Mission &amp; Vision</div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms;\"><h2 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[2.4rem] leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.025em] md:text-[4rem]\">Defining the future <br class=\"hidden md:block\">of your <span class=\"italic text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">health</span><span class=\"italic text-[color:var(--bronze)]\"> &amp; vitality.</span></h2></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 md:col-start-9\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms;\"><p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.9] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Two guiding principles shape every decision at the Schoeman Clinic: a commitment to the science of today, and to the medicine of tomorrow.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 md:mt-36 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16\"><div class=\"relative md:col-span-6 md:order-1\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 100ms;\"><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 z-10 font-serif text-[8rem] italic leading-none md:-top-20 md:text-[12rem] -left-4 md:-left-8\" style=\"color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 55%, transparent)\">01</span><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/about-mission.webp\" alt=\"A consulting room at The Schoeman Clinic, arranged for an unhurried conversation\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover tsc-kenburns\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 55%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 75%, transparent) 100%)\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-8 left-6 flex items-center gap-3 md:top-10\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg)\"><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-white/85\">The Mission</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5 md:order-2\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms;\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">The Mission</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[1.7rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2.15rem]\">Exceptional personalised medicine, delivered with precision and care.</h3><blockquote class=\"mt-8 border-l-2 pl-6 font-serif text-[1.15rem] italic leading-[1.55] text-[color:var(--foreground)] md:text-[1.3rem]\" style=\"border-color:var(--bronze)\">“Precision diagnostics. Advanced therapies. Expert clinical care.”</blockquote><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-lg text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.9] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic exists to identify and treat the root causes of complex hormonal and metabolic conditions, restoring balance, improving vitality and supporting long-term health.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-10 md:mt-36 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16\"><div class=\"relative md:col-span-6 md:order-2 md:col-start-7\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 100ms;\"><div class=\"relative\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -top-14 z-10 font-serif text-[8rem] italic leading-none md:-top-20 md:text-[12rem] -right-4 md:-right-8\" style=\"color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1px color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 55%, transparent)\">02</span><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/5] w-full overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/about-vision.webp\" alt=\"A physician's notebook and pen on the desk of a Harley Street consulting room\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover tsc-kenburns tsc-kenburns--offset-late\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 55%, color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 75%, transparent) 100%)\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-8 right-6 flex items-center gap-3 md:top-10\" style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;transform:rotate(180deg)\"><span class=\"text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.35em] text-white/85\">The Vision</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5 md:order-1 md:col-start-2\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms;\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-4\"><span class=\"text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">The Vision</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[1.7rem] leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em] md:text-[2.15rem]\">A leading centre for precision hormone and longevity medicine.</h3><blockquote class=\"mt-8 border-l-2 pl-6 font-serif text-[1.15rem] italic leading-[1.55] text-[color:var(--foreground)] md:text-[1.3rem]\" style=\"border-color:var(--bronze)\">“Clinical excellence. Transformative outcomes. A longer, more vibrant life.”</blockquote><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-lg text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.9] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">To redefine healthcare by shifting medicine from symptom management to true health optimisation, enabling patients to live longer, healthier and more vibrant lives.</p></div></div></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"relative border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 10%, transparent)\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-28 md:px-12 md:py-36\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 items-end gap-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:gap-16\"><div class=\"md:col-span-7\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><div class=\"flex items-center eyebrow\">Memberships &amp; Certifications</div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 120ms;\"><h2 class=\"mt-8 font-serif text-[2rem] leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.015em] md:text-[2.6rem]\">Held to the <span class=\"italic text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">highest standards</span> in medicine.</h2></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 220ms;\"><p class=\"max-w-md text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic and its physicians hold active memberships and recognised certifications with leading medical, functional and longevity medicine bodies: a commitment to rigour, accountability and continued clinical excellence.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-2 gap-px border-t sm:grid-cols-5 md:mt-20\" style=\"background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 10%, transparent);border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\"><div class=\"group relative flex min-h-[9rem] items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--background)] p-6 md:min-h-[10rem] md:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1), transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1);\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-bma.svg\" alt=\"British Medical Association\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-h-12 w-auto max-w-[80%] object-contain opacity-70 transition-all duration-700 group-hover:opacity-100\" style=\"filter:grayscale(1) contrast(0.95)\"><span class=\"sr-only\">British Medical Association</span></div><div class=\"group relative flex min-h-[9rem] items-center justify-center bg-[color:var(--background)] p-6 md:min-h-[10rem] md:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0px); transition: opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 50ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.7, 0.2, 1) 50ms;\"><img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-rcgp.avif\" alt=\"Royal College of General Practitioners\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-h-12 w-auto max-w-[80